# Hyperion

The Hyperion agents/skills kit lives in `./Hyperion/`.

Before planning or coding with Hyperion commands:
1. Read `.github/project.yml` (note `kit.root: Hyperion`).
2. Open skills under `Hyperion/.github/skills/**/SKILL.md`.
3. Write cards under `Hyperion/.github/cards/` (nested by parent card_id).
4. Do not copy kit files into the product root — keep artifacts inside `Hyperion/`.

Full command map: `Hyperion/CLAUDE.md` and `Hyperion/.github/commands.yml`.
